{"id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-complete-development.md","title":"完整发展","display":"df-complete-development — 完整发展","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-complete-development","aliases":["56-df-complete-development"],"display":"df-complete-development — 完整发展","depends_on":["[[56-df-development]]","[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]"],"source_section":"§4.5 Definitions 4.5.2, 4.5.11","source_printed_pages":"107,110","source_ocr_blocks":[128,131],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-complete-development"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-complete-development</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-development — 完整发展"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" href=\"?note=ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" title=\"56-df-development\">56-df-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5 Definitions 4.5.2, 4.5.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107,110"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>128</span><span>131</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>正交TRS及有限路径接口同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" href=\"?note=ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" title=\"56-df-development\">56-df-development</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,U\">\\(\\rho,U\\)</span> 为集合参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_R,\\operatorname{Dev}_R\">\\(\\mathcal D_R,\\operatorname{Dev}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" href=\"?note=ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" title=\"56-df-development\">56-df-development</a>；残余传送、首尾投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R\\mid\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R\\mid\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,U)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\\iff(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal C_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\\iff(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal C_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t\n\\iff\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\n\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=t\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t\n\\iff\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\n\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=t\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\mathrel{\\leadsto_R}t\n\\iff\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\ns\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\mathrel{\\leadsto_R}t\n\\iff\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\ns\\xRightarrow[U]{\\mathrm{cd}}_R t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“完整”要求所选初始集的全部残余消失，并不要求目标项为原TRS的正规形。关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_R\">\\(\\mathcal C_R\\)</span> 先限制到发展关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_R\">\\(\\mathcal D_R\\)</span>，所以其中的残余函数调用始终具有合法输入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CDev}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\)</span> 本身用成员关系在所有集合参数上给出真值。新建 redex 可以留下。零步路径是空集的完整发展；某个初始 redex 也可能被别的初始 redex 删除而从未单独收缩。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leadsto_R\">\\(\\leadsto_R\\)</span> 是原书 multi-step relation：允许嵌套初始 redex，区别于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a> 只同时收缩两两不交的 redex。本节只定义存在关系，存在性与唯一目标由后续 FD、FD! 提供。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Definitions 4.5.2、4.5.11；已读并按本地位置残余接口展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-development","status":"resolved","id":"ba77cd70a7f1fd67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"re