d}}_R t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CDev}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\leadsto_R","display":false}],"bytes":2110,"backlinks":[{"id":"e82b4135b6aba06c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定上述正交系统，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Disj}(U)$。$\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 与有限路径首尾投影见 [[56-df-complete-development]]，完整发展唯一目标见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]，平行关系见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]，残余拼接律见 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-complete-development.md]]"},{"id":"5d7d7db404fca095","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 见 [[56-df-complete-development]]；完整发展的存在唯一目标与残余不变性见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance]]。"},{"id":"59e4d0955d71de93","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"完整发展和唯一目标见 [[56-df-complete-development]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。"},{"id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R$ 为正交TRS，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$、$\\operatorname{Dev}_R$ 与完整发展关系见 [[56-df-complete-development]]。"}],"outgoing":["ba77cd70a7f1fd67","fec2299959a8e3bb","1f468692d9334725"]}